# ECB policy rate at {dp_ayvmv67k6qwi2tu5} from {pd_2026_09_16}

The European Central Bank's policy rate is at its highest since {pd_2025_03_12}.

The European Central Bank's policy rate stood at {dp_ayvmv67k6qwi2tu5} from {pd_2026_09_16}, up from {dp_zqmtgkcrnjro6jq4} set on {pd_2026_06_17}. That is the highest level since {pd_2025_03_12}. Further increases are likely before the end of the year.
